        "Description": "To all the magic trick enthusiasts in the country, you must choose your audience when you show your magic tricks. Never do it in front of the following people. Animals, children, magicians. First of all, animals don&apos;t understand what is magical. Children will always beg you to show them the trick. And showing magic in front of a magician is as dangerous as killing someone in front of me. Beware.",
